i>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13654989997067880470</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/send-them-to-hells-annex.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2671190567123999103' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2671190567123999103' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-58130432"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 4, 2010 at 9:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4270258565932570376</id><published>2010-07-02T17:30:06.987-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-02T17:30:06.987-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Is there nothing to be done for those imprisoned f...</title><content type='html'>Is there nothing to be done for those imprisoned falsely?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2671190567123999103/comments/default/4270258565932570376'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2671190567123999103/comments/default/4270258565932570376'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/send-them-to-hells-annex.html?showComment=1278113406987#c4270258565932570376' title=''/><author><name>Steve</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13745901786962474174</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/send-them-to-hells-annex.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2671190567123999103' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2671190567123999103' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-426324892"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 2, 2010 at 5:30 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3817761225546273087</id><published>2010-07-01T14:16:06.360-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-01T14:16:06.360-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks, Will, for providing us with yet another re...</title><content type='html'>Thanks, Will, for providing us with yet another reason to abandon banks altogether and start stuffing our GOLD AND SILVER COIN under our mattresses.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I certainly wasn&amp;#39;t surprised at this paragraph:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;Despite that warning and others, Wachovia continued to process the fraudulent transactions &amp;quot;partly because the bank charged fraud artists a large fee every time a victim spotted a bogus transaction and demanded their money back,&amp;quot; the &lt;/i&gt;Times &lt;i&gt;points out. &amp;quot;One company alone paid Wachovia about $1.5 million over 11 months....&amp;quot; &lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As you recently pointed out &lt;a href=&quot;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/amnesty-for-banksters-debtors-prison.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;, there is no longer ANY incentive whatsoever for corporations, especially the larger ones, to obey the law or even act in the fundamental best interests of their so-called &amp;quot;customers,&amp;quot; ever increasing numbers of whom are captives of these de facto monopoly trusts.  Indeed, the perpetration of fraud has become the only growth industry in a nation strangled by repressive regulation and taxation, all enacted to benefit the Wachovias, Wells Fargos, Citibanks, Chasebanks, and other beneficiaries of the TBTF world of finance, all of which have had their claws anchored in the flesh of the political classes for well over a century and a half (to the extent, that is, that there has ever been any difference between the two to begin with). &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;My advice to everyone who holds any kind of long-term debt, whether secured or unsecured, is to accelerate its payoff (or, in the case of a home mortgage, consider strategic default) IMMEDIATELY and close any accounts after they are paid in full.  Sure, it might &amp;quot;damage your credit rating,&amp;quot; but given the coming implosion of the credit markets, the initial stages of which we&amp;#39;re seeing unfold before our very eyes right now, it won&amp;#39;t matter in the long run.  Better to close ANY avenues by which these slimy criminal syndicates can extort from you more of your hard-earned wealth than to rely on them for a financial safety net.  If nothing else, maybe &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.investopedia.com/articles/pf/06/zombie-debt.asp&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;this horrifying trend&lt;/a&gt; will convince you of the wisdom of this course of action better than anything else.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2671190567123999103/comments/default/3817761225546273087'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2671190567123999103/comments/default/3817761225546273087'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/send-them-to-hells-annex.html?showComment=1278015366360#c3817761225546273087' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/send-them-to-hells-annex.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2671190567123999103' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2671190567123999103' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 1, 2010 at 2:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6686103429808983708</id><published>2010-06-30T17:12:27.495-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-30T17:12:27.495-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It was all supposed to be diffirent.  &#xa;&#xa;&amp;quot;They...</title><content type='html'>It was all supposed to be diffirent.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;They write the checks and you get stuck with the bills, they get the access while you get to write a letter, they think they own this government, but we&amp;#39;re here today to take it back. The time for that kind of politics is over.&amp;quot; B-Ho announcing his Intentions for presidency February 2007&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mr. Grigg this is perhaps your greatest essay yet at showing us what Government and Law enforcement actually does as opposed to what it claims to do.  It is a bought and paid for Crminal syndicate which is not necessary for civiliazation to grow and prosper, and is actually detrimental to that prospering.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2671190567123999103/comments/default/6686103429808983708'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2671190567123999103/comments/default/6686103429808983708'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/send-them-to-hells-annex.html?showComment=1277939547495#c6686103429808983708' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><th